OL,3,GNEWSAKatie Price ex said alleged rape
OL,4,Avictim could be his 'best friend'
OL,5,
OL,6,FKate Price's ex-husband told a teenager
OL,7,Fhe allegedly raped that "she could be
OL,8,Fhis best friend", a jury has heard.
OL,10,FKieran Hayler is accused of three
OL,11,Fcounts of rape and one count of sexual
OL,12,Fassault against a 13-year-old girl in
OL,13,FWest Sussex in 2016.
OL,15,FThe 39-year-old denies the charges.
OL,17,FOn Friday, the teen's mother described
OL,18,Fto Lewes Crown Court what her daughter
OL,19,Ftold her about Hayler.
